  "description": "<p>There is a &lt;prerequisite&gt; block in the <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-parent/pom.xml#L480-L482\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">fcrepo-parent pom file</a>.</p>\n\n<p>During build you get a warning<br/>\n<span class=\"error\">&#91;WARNING&#93;</span> The project org.fcrepo:fcrepo-parent:pom:6.0.0-SNAPSHOT uses prerequisites which is only intended for maven-plugin projects but not for non maven-plugin projects. For such purposes you should use the maven-enforcer-plugin. See <a href=\"https://maven.apache.org/enforcer/enforcer-rules/requireMavenVersion.html\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://maven.apache.org/enforcer/enforcer-rules/requireMavenVersion.html</a><br/>\nAs such and because we have the maven-enforcer-plugin in the <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/pom.xml#L661\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">main pom file</a>, this can be removed.</p>",
